  "prefLabel": "Rev 501.14 Supplemental",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 501.14 \"Supplemental\" means a subsequent filing by an owner, in a tax year, of the Form PA-38, “Notice of Intent to Excavate”, with the assessing officials in the municipality in which the excavating is to take place to make corrections or additions to the information contained in the original Form PA-38.\n\nSource. #9926, eff 5-18-11 (from 501.11); ss by #12834, eff 7-25-19",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/rev500.html"
